{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1SA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"撒母耳记上","commonName":"撒母耳记上","title":"撒母耳记上","order":9,"numberOfChapters":31,"sha256":"624563e66dcc500ce4929a275e79e1d4567d9140103452528467b0ae407086d9","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1SA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":31,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1SA/31.json","totalNumberOfVerses":809},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["扫罗和他儿子的死"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["非利士人与以色列人争战。以色列人在非利士人面前逃跑，在基利波有被杀仆倒的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["非利士人紧追扫罗和他儿子们，就杀了扫罗的儿子约拿单、亚比拿达、麦基舒亚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["势派甚大，扫罗被弓箭手追上，射伤甚重，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["就吩咐拿他兵器的人说：「你拔出刀来，将我刺死，免得那些未受割礼的人来刺我，凌辱我。」但拿兵器的人甚惧怕，不肯刺他；扫罗就自己伏在刀上死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["拿兵器的人见扫罗已死，也伏在刀上死了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["这样，扫罗和他三个儿子，与拿他兵器的人，以及跟随他的人，都一同死亡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["住平原那边并约旦河西的以色列人，见以色列军兵逃跑，扫罗和他儿子都死了，也就弃城逃跑。非利士人便来住在其中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["次日，非利士人来剥那被杀之人的衣服，看见扫罗和他三个儿子仆倒在基利波山，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["就割下他的首级，剥了他的军装，打发人到",{"noteId":7},"非利士地的四境，报信与他们庙里的偶像和众民；"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["又将扫罗的军装放在亚斯她录庙里，将他的尸身钉在伯·珊的城墙上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["基列·雅比的居民听见非利士人向扫罗所行的事，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他们中间所有的勇士就起身，走了一夜，将扫罗和他儿子的尸身从伯·珊城墙上取下来，送到雅比那里，用火烧了；"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["将他们骸骨葬在雅比的垂丝柳树下，就禁食七日。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"-","text":"或译：送到","reference":{"chapter":31,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1SA/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2SA/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1SA/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}